                <head>Appendix 314</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Note by the Permanent Committee</hi>
                        [<hi rendition="#italic">Regarding</hi>] <hi rendition="#italic">Exchange
                        Situation in Europe</hi></p>
                <p>The following memorandum to various European Governments on the financial
                    situation of Europe is submitted by the Permanent Committee to the Council for
                    such action as the Council may think desirable.</p>
                <p>2/2/20.</p>
